/T (The freelance economy has experienced rapid growth in recent years due to advancements in digital technology, widespread internet access, and the increasing acceptance of remote work. Organizations and individuals now prefer hiring freelancers for short-term or project-based tasks instead of maintaining full-time employees. Services such as graphic design, web development, content writing, digital marketing, video editing, and software development are commonly outsourced to freelancers.)
/E (The freelance economy has experienced rapid growth in recent years due to advancements in digital technology, widespread internet access, and the increasing acceptance of remote work. Organizations and individuals now prefer hiring freelancers for short-term or project-based tasks instead of maintaining full-time employees. Services such as graphic design, web development, content writing, digital marketing, video editing, and software development are commonly outsourced to freelancers.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
194 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 735 0 R
/T (Despite this growth, both clients and freelancers face several challenges. Clients often struggle to find skilled and trustworthy professionals within their budget, while freelancers find it difficult to secure consistent and genuine work opportunities. A Freelance Service Marketplace aims to bridge this gap by providing a centralized platform where clients and freelancers can interact, collaborate, and complete projects efficiently. The platform ensures secure communication, transparent transactions, and effective project management.)
/E (Despite this growth, both clients and freelancers face several challenges. Clients often struggle to find skilled and trustworthy professionals within their budget, while freelancers find it difficult to secure consistent and genuine work opportunities. A Freelance Service Marketplace aims to bridge this gap by providing a centralized platform where clients and freelancers can interact, collaborate, and complete projects efficiently. The platform ensures secure communication, transparent transactions, and effective project management.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
